    "Cost": 6192728,
    "UIName": "Vulture Mk IV",
    "Id": "chassisdef_vulture_mk_iv_VLTIV-Z",
    "Name": "Vulture Mk IV",
    "Details": "The Vulture Mk IV Z is a 60-ton OmniMech configured as a versatile fire-support platform. A pair of Artemis V-equipped LRM-15 launchers provide accurate long-range fire, while four Medium Pulse Lasers give it substantial firepower when enemies close the distance. Ferro-Lamellor armor improves its survivability, while a Nova CEWS and Light TAG allow the Vulture to provide targeting and electronic support to allied units.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Protected Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.11</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
